the type of value means: @intrinsic("type of", value)
flex section if condition:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("if", condition)
first equals second means: @intrinsic("equal", first, second)
to get sample:
    if 1 equals 1:
        @intrinsic("return", 7)
    @intrinsic("return", 0)
to get {the type of sample:first} equals {the type of sample:second}:
    @intrinsic("return", @intrinsic("equal", first, second))
@intrinsic("store", result, sample)
